/// 员工周期绩效评审事实表（来源于 HR 绩效流程归档；Work/OKR/KPI 证据以快照 JSON 固化）
model HrPerformanceReview {
  id                Int       @id @default(autoincrement())
  employeeId        Int
  okrCycleId        Int
  approvalRequestId Int?
  selfScore         Int?
  selfComment       String    @default("")
  managerScore      Int?
  managerComment    String    @default("")
  finalScore        Int
  finalGrade        String
  hrComment         String    @default("")
  workEvidenceSnapshotJson String @default("{}")
  archivedByUserId  Int?
  archivedAt        DateTime  @default(now())
  editedBy          Int?
  editedAt          DateTime?
  version           Int       @default(1)
  createdAt         DateTime  @default(now())
  updatedAt         DateTime  @default(now()) @updatedAt
  employee          Employee  @relation(fields: [employeeId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)

  @@unique([employeeId, okrCycleId])
  @@index([okrCycleId])
  @@index([approvalRequestId])
  @@index([finalGrade])
  @@index([archivedAt])
}
